Package: SeRiouS
Title: Create and Export Interactive 'Shiny' Learning Capsules
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
      given = "Sébastien",
      family = "Lê",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "sebastien.lel@institut-agro.fr"
    )
Description: Provides tools to define, validate, run, and share interactive
    learning capsules built around a board-game metaphor. Capsules combine
    ordered steps, unlockable questions, R code execution, console outputs,
    plots, and local resources. They can be run locally as 'Shiny'
    applications and optionally exported as standalone 'shinylive'
    applications for simple web-compatible capsules.
